---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  currentPath="/contact/"
  title="Contact | TRACED"
  description="Reach Jonathan R. Reed about case file corrections, source questions, bugs, or privacy questions on TRACED."
>

  <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="page">
    <header class="page-head band">
      <h1>Contact</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        If you spot a mistake in a case file, run into a broken page, or have a question about how the site handles
        data, you can reach me through my main site.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a class="btn" href="https://jonathanrreed.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Go to jonathanrreed.com<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
        </a>
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="wrap">

      <div class="prose">
        <section>
          <h2>Before you write</h2>
          <p>
            Please don't send passwords, private keys, personal documents, or raw breach dumps. I don't need any
            sensitive files to check a source or fix a page.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>What helps</h2>
          <p>
            For a correction, include the case name and a link to the public source showing what's wrong. As long as
            the public record backs it up, I can update the title, dates, leaked data types, or source details. If
            you're reporting a bug, just tell me which URL broke, what you saw, and what browser you were using.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>What I can't help with</h2>
          <p>
            I can't check whether a specific person was in a breach or look up who owns an account, and I don't accept
            raw breach files. Since every record here comes straight from Have I Been Pwned, any removal or takedown
            request has to go through HIBP directly.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
